§§ `ss 14-17, 22A -- orders`

-- Order: satisfied, acted as employee, employer precautions, employed by them, termination, Fair Work application, it ended.
#ASSERT `What can the court order for the reprisal against me?` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS (LIST `compensation from the person who took the reprisal`, `compensation from their employer alone or jointly or in part`, `an injunction restraining the reprisal or requiring them to do what they refused to do`, `an apology`, `any other order the court thinks appropriate`, `reinstatement in my position or one at a comparable level`)
#ASSERT `What can the court order for the reprisal against me?` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS (LIST `compensation from the person who took the reprisal`, `an injunction restraining the reprisal or requiring them to do what they refused to do`, `an apology`, `any other order the court thinks appropriate`)
-- s 14(2): the employer's reasonable precautions and due diligence remove (1)(b).
#ASSERT `What can the court order for the reprisal against me?` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS (LIST `compensation from the person who took the reprisal`, `an injunction restraining the reprisal or requiring them to do what they refused to do`, `an apology`, `any other order the court thinks appropriate`)
-- s 16 needs both employment by the respondent and a termination.
#ASSERT `What can the court order for the reprisal against me?` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS (LIST `compensation from the person who took the reprisal`, `an injunction restraining the reprisal or requiring them to do what they refused to do`, `an apology`, `any other order the court thinks appropriate`)
#ASSERT `What can the court order for the reprisal against me?` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS (LIST `compensation from the person who took the reprisal`, `an injunction restraining the reprisal or requiring them to do what they refused to do`, `an apology`, `any other order the court thinks appropriate`)
#ASSERT `What can the court order for the reprisal against me?` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS (LIST `compensation from the person who took the reprisal`, `an injunction restraining the reprisal or requiring them to do what they refused to do`, `an apology`, `any other order the court thinks appropriate`, `reinstatement in my position or one at a comparable level`)
#ASSERT `What can the court order for the reprisal against me?` FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS EMPTY
-- s 22A: a Fair Work application on the same conduct bars this one, unless discontinued or failed for want of jurisdiction.
#ASSERT `What can the court order for the reprisal against me?` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `What can the court order for the reprisal against me?` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS (LIST `compensation from the person who took the reprisal`, `compensation from their employer alone or jointly or in part`, `an injunction restraining the reprisal or requiring them to do what they refused to do`, `an apology`, `any other order the court thinks appropriate`, `reinstatement in my position or one at a comparable level`)

